 "id": "4526900444203911", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830904_4526900447537244_1593155788570280980_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eaxNgUMGuUwQ7kNvwGGyBjX&_nc_oc=AdrQO8a6KJYImpXcmBwUS96h4yEY0SDpuk-I5R8npulkJl6cV95viI909YGWioijKcI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFdAJbwdNkV4oGXRf2djDe8JLxYHT49u5s_zfVZ4MZayw&oe=6A7097E6"}, "display_name": "The Historical Art Gallery", "keywords": ["AI", "Gallery", "Art", "Paintings", "History"], "long_description": "The Historical Art Gallery is a collection of famous historical paintings like:\n- The Scream, by Edvard Munch\n- La Promenade, by Pierre-Auguste Renoir\n- The Music Lesson, by Johannes Vermeer\n- Starry Night Over the Rh\u00f4ne, by Vincent van Gogh\n- Four Seasons in One Head, at and by Giuseppe Arcimboldo\n- In the Loge, by Mary Cassatt\n... and more\n\nHere you have a nice gallery environment setup with the statue of a horse in the middle, as an extra you can see how the AI animate the paintings.", "short_description": "The Historical Art Gallery is a collection of famous historical paintings like:\n- The Scream, by Edvard Munch\n- La Promenade, by Pierre-Auguste Renoir\n- The Music Lesson, by Johannes Vermeer\n- Starry Night Over the Rh\u00f4ne, by Vincent van Gogh\n- Four Seasons in One Head, at and by Giuseppe Arcimboldo\n- In the Loge, by Mary Cassatt\n... and more\n\nHere you have a nice gallery environment setup with the statue of a horse in the middle, as an extra you can see how the AI animate the paintings."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/privacy-policy-updated-at-2021-09-17.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Midi Creations", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/who-are-we-indie-virtual-reality-video.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags":